but this option is not available to me

22
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.240
and I need to change to something called

23
00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.980
the Pay as You Go option,

24
00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.780
but it's not available to me either here.

25
00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.340
So it was is a little bit slow

26
